# The client every plugin in this repo is built and checked against.
#
# "latest" is the right answer here, unlike in RuneLite's hub where the same file pins a version:
# every push to the client's dev-logging branch publishes a release, and every player's launcher
# fetches the newest one before it starts the game. The client players are running IS latest, so
# building against anything older would check these plugins against a client nobody has.
#
# Put an explicit tag here - client-80 - to rebuild the index exactly as it was built then, or to
# hold the plugins back while a client change settles.
latest
